# Checklist maintenance

When working from a checklist or task list, keep it updated in real time.

- As soon as an item is fully completed, immediately mark it as completed (for example, change `- [ ]` to `- [x]`).
- Do not batch checklist updates until the end of the task.
- Never report checklist work as done while the checklist still shows it as incomplete.
